  <jpcrp_cor:DisposalsOrHoldingOfAcquiredTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4&gt;（４）【取得自己株式の処理状況及び保有状況】&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 648px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 292px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 84px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 94px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 84px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 94px"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 27px"&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 292px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
